tip = "Nearest: within 2 cells of the one it hit. Once per attack. A heavy Warden attacks slowly and hits hard (the Acorn and Pebbling lines, Frostfern, Silver Bell). Firefly Wardens' own heavy forms don't count. Works for: another family's heavy Wardens, and Sprouts, near a Firefly Warden. Safe."
